Use payments from mcp "pwsh -NoProfile -NonInteractive -File ../../tools/mcp-test-server.ps1"
Allow network access and changing external systems

A FailedPayment has an id which is a string and a retryCount which is an integer
A RetryResult has a succeeded which is a boolean and an errorMessage which is a string

To RecoverFailures, given a day which is a string, returning an integer
    the response is ask payments to list_failed with the day
    the failures are the response as a list of FailedPayment
    the retried is 0
    for each payment in the failures
        if the retryCount of the payment is less than 3
            the outcome is ask payments to retry with paymentId set to the id of the payment
            the result is the outcome as a RetryResult
            if the succeeded of the result
                the retried is the retried plus 1
    return the retried
